{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_dev_ops_session_handoff_2026_08_05_nomenclature_ux_audit_handoff", "label": "Session handoff 2026-08-05: Nomenclature UX audit waves + prod hygiene", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "Docs/dev/ops/session-handoff-2026-08-05-nomenclature-ux-audit.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_dev_ops_session_handoff_2026_08_05_nomenclature_ux_audit_parallel_agent_seam_bugs", "label": "Bugs live at the seams between parallel agents", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Working scheme: keep shared layers (API client, hooks, lib/, locales) with the coordinator, give each agent one file/module, agents return i18n keys as a table instead of editing dictionaries. But bugs live at the SEAMS, not inside an agent's scope: each agent's gates are green and each is right about itself while the contract between them drifts. Caught three times (base_price_currency missing from the detail serializer so the card price would never render; code with a parameter vs code without; a badge computing one thing and labelled another). Manual seam review after fan-out is mandatory.", "source_file": "Docs/dev/ops/session-handoff-2026-08-05-nomenclature-ux-audit.md", "source_location": "section 6", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_dev_ops_session_handoff_2026_08_05_nomenclature_ux_audit_ci_dead_billing", "label": "CI dead by GitHub Actions billing while deploy stays alive", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "All CI jobs fail in 2 seconds with zero steps and no logs (GitHub Actions billing); only the owner can fix it. The deploy is a self-hosted runner and stays alive \u2014 so prod updates from an unverified CI main. Everything merged that day was gated locally instead: backend 1997 passed, vitest 783, build, eslint, i18n-symmetry, flake8, black, isort, makemigrations --check, all by exit code zero.", "source_file": "Docs/dev/ops/session-handoff-2026-08-05-nomenclature-ux-audit.md", "source_location": "section 7", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_dev_ops_session_handoff_2026_08_05_nomenclature_ux_audit_audit_closure_561", "label": "Audit closed entirely: R2+R3+R5b final wave (#561)", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Owner rightly noted the VISIBLE redesign had not happened despite five waves shipped \u2014 menu, tiles and deadends unchanged; lesson: visible waves must not be deferred, the owner judges by the screen. #561 delivered the target picture \u00a75.1\u20135.7: unified '\u041c\u043e\u0438 \u0442\u043e\u0432\u0430\u0440\u044b' registry with tabs and bulk-archive, card-as-page #product-edit/{id} with manual specifications editor, import-catalog-ai. Also closed a live prod bug: hs_lookup/hs_classify raised TypeError (handler signature vs dispatcher mismatch) under fully green tests \u2014 batch \u0422\u041d \u0412\u042d\u0414 matching never worked; an invariant test on the handler registry was added.", "source_file": "Docs/dev/ops/session-handoff-2026-08-05-nomenclature-ux-audit.md", "source_location": "addendum 2026-08-06", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_dev_ops_session_handoff_2026_08_05_nomenclature_ux_audit_handoff", "target": "docs_dev_specs_spec_nomenclature_ux_audit_2026_08_05_spec", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Docs/dev/ops/session-handoff-2026-08-05-nomenclature-ux-audit.md", "source_location": "section 1", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_dev_ops_session_handoff_2026_08_05_nomenclature_ux_audit_handoff", "target": "docs_dev_specs_spec_nomenclature_open_questions_2026_08_05_spec", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Docs/dev/ops/session-handoff-2026-08-05-nomenclature-ux-audit.md", "source_location": "section 3", "